        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>SGS HD3600-622, 36 Inch Black Round Ladder Style Door Pull </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n36 Inch Black Round Ladder Style Door Pull is a beautiful modern pull done with the today's most popular decorating designs in mind. The sleek, clean lines paired with a contemporary finish, is a great way to update any door.  This modern ladder door pull is available with thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting--just make sure to order 2 pulls if you choose to mount your pulls back to back.\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary door handle is made from <b>1-1/4\" diameter</b> round tubing. It has a 24\" center to center mounting (distance between the 2 mounting screws).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SGS-HD3600-dimension.gif?v=1774586591\" width=\"503\" height=\"128\" border=\"0\" alt=\"36 Inch Ladder Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Modern 36\" Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Length: 24\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1-1/4\" Round Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
