                "description": "SGS HD3600, 36 Inch Modern Ladder Pull - 36 Inch Black Round Ladder Style Door Pull is a beautiful modern pull done with the today's most popular decorating designs in mind. The sleek, clean lines paired with a contemporary finish, is a great way to update any door.  This modern ladder door pull is available with thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting--just make sure to order 2 pulls if you choose to mount your pulls back to back.",
